==Strategy==
This stage is quite simple. The best cats to use here are basic [[:Category:Meatshield-class Cats|meatshields]], units like [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], or [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|area attackers]] like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]].

